+    // prime counter (fail-closed detection, die-s81-85 11-09; default netlist unchanged).  All rl[] leaves release on
+    // the same edge E.  The chunk columns (rst_n = rl[26 + gc]) open their slice-0 q pins only for ql_v >= E + 6 at
