+    // measured, + 3 edges margin = the coordinator's "header >= 6 edges after release").  A header with pk < PRIME
+    // pulses pr_f -> fc_set[5] (header protocol cause, as hbad1) -> sticky fc -> fault / st / gather p1_f until reset.
+    // The stream is not stalled or changed.  MUT: PRIME 3 edges short.
+    // portfix178 (bound b178): fault path fc -> fc_any -> 1-b fault port / p1_f.
+`ifdef OT_IDX_RG3_PRIME_MUT
